  "title": "Answer: humans, animals and integrated organisms, not present AI",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "7940e149-c9ca-4362-849e-e74e430b3c60",
      "text": "What counts as an entity, and so as conscious, is anything satisfying the three projections at once: humans, animals and integrated biological systems. Every human qualifies. Large language models, cameras, thermostats and rivers do not.",
